+        // During a backhaul switch (wired<->wireless), FH VAP toggling is handled separately
+        // via ACTION_BACKHAUL_FH_VAPS_STATE_NOTIFICATION. Only call send_fh_vap_state_to_ap_managers
+        // for normal (non-switch) bSTA connect/disconnect events.
